flowchart TD
    A[ObjectBuffer.__init__] --> B{output_to}
    B -- "file" --> C[Open output file]
    B -- else --> D[No file output]
    A --> E[ObjectBuffer.start]
    E --> F[Create socket & connect]
    F --> G[Start _send_message thread]
    A --> H[ObjectBuffer.put]
    H --> I{Queue full?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Remove oldest frame]
    I -- No --> K[Put message in queue]
    G --> L[_send_message loop]
    L --> M{Get message from queue}
    M -- Success --> N{output_to}
    N -- "socket" --> O[_serialize_message]
    O --> P[Send via socket]
    P --> Q[Wait for server reply]
    N -- "file" --> R[Dump message to file]
    N -- "none" --> S[Do nothing]
    N -- else --> T[Raise Exception]
    M -- Empty --> U[Pass]
    L --> V[Queue task_done]
    A --> W[ObjectBuffer.stop]
    W --> X[Queue join]
    X --> Y[Stop thread]
    Y --> Z[Close socket & terminate context]